    "assertions": [
      "Work in progress: native node/document interfaces and pointer ownership are implemented over pinned libxml2. Focused source QA bodies and real graph integration pass. Builder service, XPath, document SAX/IO facets, full DOM coverage, compiled C++ differential/thread ABI, metadata initialization and complete DOCX/XLSX file/UI paths remain unverified. No substitute node provider or alternate JS tree is installed.",
      "Original SAXParseException value uses actual SAXException inheritance, four declared members, shared CPPU metadata and real Any copy/extraction. Native documentbuilder error formatting preserves ASCII_US, line/int2 and empty identifier/context/wrapped defaults. IO callbacks use actual input streams and byte sequences, preserve close/freeOnClose statement order, and contain only UNO exceptions. Builder orchestration, UCB entity resolver/URI fallback and service registration remain unported; no alternate DocumentBuilder or fake process context is advertised. Native threading/ABI, complete upstream parser QA and DOCX/XLSX file/UI acceptance remain unverified.",
      "Original resolve_func converts nullable public/system IDs through actual RTL values, calls the genuine XEntityResolver and transfers actual InputSource stream ownership to a heap context and native libxml2 input buffer. XML_CHAR_ENCODING_NONE remains the original argument for both native calls; returned encoding/identifier metadata is not substituted (CALC-532/WRITER466). Native source context close/freeOnClose ordering and its recorded failure behavior remain unchanged. Actual public and system-only external DTDs exercise the resolver ABI with explicit raw-library DTDLOAD qualification; builder default options remain zero. Builder/UCB orchestration, full source service QA, physical ABI and DOCX/XLSX/UI acceptance remain unverified."
    ],
    "capability": "Native UNO DOM tree and document factory",
